Far too many items become almost useless once you have one unicorn horn.

To keep the unicorn horn in check, why not treat it as both a weapon and 
an item for both enchantment and charging?

So you can dip it in potions of gain energy or use a scroll of charging 
(or the PYEC) to increase its enchantment.  (Just be careful not to 
destroy it by overenchanting it...)

The price is that only +1 or better horns can cure things (and only -1 
or lower horns can inflict things) and each successful use reduces the 
enchantment one step closer to zero.

Spellbooks of Cure Blindness (and carrots) will finally be useful.

